      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "1. FOUNDATIONS & SETUP\n\n• Repository and .git directory\n• Working tree → staging area\n  → commit\n• Branch and remote\n• user.name / user.email\n• System / global / local scopes\n• Help and configuration inspection",
      "originalText": "1. FOUNDATIONS & SETUP\n\n• Repository and .git directory\n• Working tree → staging area\n  → commit\n• Branch and remote\n• user.name / user.email\n• System / global / local scopes\n• Help and configuration inspection",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
