      "seed": 9,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 9,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788602472196,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "3. BRANCHES & INTEGRATION\n\n• Branch = isolated line of work\n• Name it by team convention\n• Merge: preserve shared history\n• Rebase: rewrite local commits\n• Conflict: understand both intents\n• Protected branch + review\n\nDo not rebase/force-push casually",
      "originalText": "3. BRANCHES & INTEGRATION\n\n• Branch = isolated line of work\n• Name it by team convention\n• Merge: preserve shared history\n• Rebase: rewrite local commits\n• Conflict: understand both intents\n• Protected branch + review\n\nDo not rebase/force-push casually",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
