      "seed": 11,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 11,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788602472196,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "4. REMOTES & GITHUB\n\n• origin is only a convention\n• fetch: update remote information\n• pull: fetch + integrate\n• push: publish changes\n• HTTPS or SSH authentication\n• Pull request: review before merge\n\nInspect the remote before pushing",
      "originalText": "4. REMOTES & GITHUB\n\n• origin is only a convention\n• fetch: update remote information\n• pull: fetch + integrate\n• push: publish changes\n• HTTPS or SSH authentication\n• Pull request: review before merge\n\nInspect the remote before pushing",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "safety-box",
      "type": "rectangle",
