      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "LEARNING ORDER\n\n① Git model + configuration\n② Daily local workflow\n③ Branches, merge, conflicts\n④ Remotes, authentication, PRs\n\nThen move on to:\n• tags, stash, worktree\n• advanced history\n• recovery and automation",
      "originalText": "LEARNING ORDER\n\n① Git model + configuration\n② Daily local workflow\n③ Branches, merge, conflicts\n④ Remotes, authentication, PRs\n\nThen move on to:\n• tags, stash, worktree\n• advanced history\n• recovery and automation",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
